{% import "macros.njk" as m %}
<h1>Module editorial sections</h1>
<p class="emst-lede">Subsector depth (water, air, waste, environmental health and others) drafted centrally by EMST's AI agents. These are editorial sections, not stewarded modules: no organization is involved or has committed to steward them, and any advisory partners are potential ones only. They are kept out of the default HR views.</p>
{{ m.statFigure(emst.competencies.length - emst.coreCompetencies.length, "Module competency records", emst.figures.moduleCompetencies) }}
<ul class="emst-cards">
{% for md in emst.moduleList %}
  <li class="emst-card"><h2><a href="{{ ('/modules/' + md.ns + '/') | url }}">{{ md.label }}</a></h2>
  <p>{{ md.code }}{% if md.wave %} · wave {{ md.wave }}{% endif %} · {{ md.competencies.length }} competency records</p></li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
